WEBVTT

00:00:27.403 --> 00:00:30.545
by career crises, by moments
when what we thought we knew --

00:00:30.569 --> 00:00:32.379
about our lives, about our careers --

00:00:32.403 --> 00:00:35.832
comes into contact
with a threatening sort of reality.

00:00:35.856 --> 00:00:39.609
It's perhaps easier now than ever before
to make a good living.

00:00:39.633 --> 00:00:41.976
It's perhaps harder than ever before

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.976
to stay calm, to be free
of career anxiety.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.389
I want to look now, if I may,
at some of the reasons

00:00:48.413 --> 00:00:51.976
why we might be feeling
anxiety about our careers.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.239
Why we might be victims
of these career crises,

00:00:54.263 --> 00:00:58.209
as we're weeping softly into our pillows.

00:00:58.233 --> 00:01:00.976
One of the reasons
why we might be suffering